{"h":"<h2>关于：</h2><p>我调整了官方工作流程，使其更加方便。我强烈推荐使用掩蔽的“人物替换功能”。</p><p>通过打开/关闭图像2和图像3，可以输出各种图像。</p><p>案例一：免费描述</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/7587f63e-a0f2-4880-843a-376b1cba7735/width=525/7587f63e-a0f2-4880-843a-376b1cba7735.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>案例2：换装</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/8f600154-bc90-440b-b8eb-414ca5b301b2/width=525/8f600154-bc90-440b-b8eb-414ca5b301b2.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>案例3：服装变更+姿势变更</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/64353112-49ff-44bc-bfdc-8fd915471438/width=525/64353112-49ff-44bc-bfdc-8fd915471438.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>案例4：性格改变</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e98e0cac-0c9d-4130-9cb1-60af92ee77a6/width=525/e98e0cac-0c9d-4130-9cb1-60af92ee77a6.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":{"en":"<h2>About：</h2><p>I've tweaked the official workflow to make it a bit more convenient. I highly recommend the “person replacement feature” using masking.</p><p>By toggling image2 and image3 ON/OFF, various images can be output.</p><p>Case 1: Free Description</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/7587f63e-a0f2-4880-843a-376b1cba7735/width=525/7587f63e-a0f2-4880-843a-376b1cba7735.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>Case 2: Costume Change</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/8f600154-bc90-440b-b8eb-414ca5b301b2/width=525/8f600154-bc90-440b-b8eb-414ca5b301b2.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>Case 3: Costume Change + Pose Change</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/64353112-49ff-44bc-bfdc-8fd915471438/width=525/64353112-49ff-44bc-bfdc-8fd915471438.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>Case 4: Character Change</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e98e0cac-0c9d-4130-9cb1-60af92ee77a6/width=525/e98e0cac-0c9d-4130-9cb1-60af92ee77a6.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>"}}